#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Troubleshooting Guide"
msgstr "Troubleshooting Guide"

msgid "Rerun camera views and joint plots for inspecting robot behavior."
msgstr "Robot 동작을 점검하는 Rerun camera view와 joint plot입니다."

msgid "This page consolidates troubleshooting information from across this learning path for easy access."
msgstr "과정 전체의 troubleshooting 안내를 한곳에 모았습니다."

msgid ""
"All workshop commands run in the single `so101-workshop` container with its Python environment "
"active. Keep using the terminal started in [Get the Code](06-get-the-code.md#start-the-workshop-"
"container), stopping each exercise before starting the next. Extra shells are optional; see "
"[container shell recovery](container-shell-recovery)."
msgstr ""
"모든 명령은 Python environment가 활성화된 하나의 `so101-workshop` container에서 실행합니다. [Get the Code](06-get-"
"the-code.md#start-the-workshop-container)의 terminal을 계속 사용하고 각 실습을 종료한 뒤 다음을 시작하세요. 추가 shell은 선택 "
"사항입니다. [Container shell recovery](container-shell-recovery)를 참고하세요."

msgid "Hardware Issues"
msgstr "Hardware 문제"

msgid "First Thing to Try"
msgstr "먼저 시도할 방법"

msgid ""
"Unplug power, and replug the power cable. Do this 2X if the next command doesn't run. If that "
"doesn't solve, proceed to the next steps."
msgstr "전원 cable을 분리했다가 다시 연결하세요. 다음 명령이 실행되지 않으면 한 번 더 반복합니다. 해결되지 않으면 아래 절차를 진행하세요."

msgid "Robot Doesn't Respond"
msgstr "Robot이 응답하지 않음"

msgid "**Check** USB connection"
msgstr "USB 연결을 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Verify** power LED is on"
msgstr "Power LED가 켜졌는지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Try** a different USB port"
msgstr "다른 USB port를 **시험**합니다."

msgid "Inside the `so101-workshop` container, **run** `lerobot-find-port` to confirm the port is correct."
msgstr "`so101-workshop` container에서 `lerobot-find-port`를 **실행**해 올바른 port인지 확인합니다."

msgid "No Ports Found or Permission Denied on /dev/ttyACM*"
msgstr "Port를 찾지 못하거나 /dev/ttyACM* 접근 권한 오류"

msgid "If `lerobot-find-port` finds no ports, or you see permission denied when accessing the robot:"
msgstr "`lerobot-find-port`가 port를 찾지 못하거나 permission denied가 발생하면:"

msgid ""
"First, check the USB connection and confirm that the workshop container was started with the "
"documented `/dev` mount and `--privileged` option. Re-run `lerobot-find-port` at the same "
"container prompt after reconnecting the device."
msgstr ""
"먼저 USB 연결과 문서에 나온 `/dev` mount, `--privileged` 옵션으로 container를 시작했는지 확인합니다. Device를 다시 연결한 뒤 같은 "
"prompt에서 `lerobot-find-port`를 재실행하세요."

msgid "If permissions still fail and a host-side fix is needed:"
msgstr "계속 권한 오류가 나고 host 수정이 필요하면:"

msgid ""
"**Stop** the active exercise, then **exit** the main container shell to return to the host "
"prompt. With the documented `--rm` invocation, this stops and removes the container; mounted "
"files persist."
msgstr ""
"현재 실습을 **중단**하고 main container shell을 **종료**해 host prompt로 돌아갑니다. 문서의 `--rm` 실행 방식에서는 container가 "
"종료·제거되지만 mount된 파일은 유지됩니다."

msgid ""
"On the **host**, **grant** read/write access only to the connected serial ports you identified "
"(the paths below are examples):"
msgstr "**Host**에서 확인한 연결 serial port에만 read/write 권한을 **부여**합니다. 아래 경로는 예시입니다."

msgid ""
"Permissions reset when devices are reconnected; re-run these after unplugging/replugging USB if "
"needed."
msgstr "Device 재연결 시 권한이 초기화되므로 필요하면 USB를 다시 연결한 뒤 명령을 반복합니다."

msgid ""
"For persistent **host** access, **add** your host user to the `dialout` group (and `video` for "
"cameras), then log out and back in:"
msgstr "지속적인 **host** 접근이 필요하면 사용자를 `dialout` group(camera는 `video`)에 **추가**하고 logout/login합니다."

msgid ""
"**Restart** the workshop container using [Get the Code](06-get-the-code.md#start-the-workshop-"
"container), then verify ports and saved settings."
msgstr ""
"[Get the Code](06-get-the-code.md#start-the-workshop-container)에 따라 container를 **재시작**하고 port와 저장"
" 설정을 확인합니다."

msgid "Power Not Connected (All Motors Missing)"
msgstr "전원 미연결(All Motors Missing)"

msgid "If you see this error showing all motors missing:"
msgstr "모든 motor가 없다는 다음 오류가 보이면:"

msgid ""
"This indicates **power is not connected** to the robot. The USB connection allows communication, "
"but the motors need separate power."
msgstr "Robot의 **전원이 연결되지 않았다는 뜻**입니다. USB는 통신을 제공하지만 motor에는 별도 전원이 필요합니다."

msgid "**Solution:**"
msgstr "**해결 방법:**"

msgid "**Connect** the 12V power supply to the robot"
msgstr "Follower robot에 12V 전원을 **연결**합니다."

msgid "**Verify** the power LED illuminates"
msgstr "Power LED를 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Retry** the command"
msgstr "명령을 **재시도**합니다."

msgid "Single Motor Disconnected"
msgstr "Motor 하나의 연결 끊김"

msgid "If you see an error showing one motor missing:"
msgstr "Motor 하나가 없다는 오류가 보이면:"

msgid ""
"This indicates motor 1 is disconnected or not communicating. Sometimes this will happen "
"unexpectedly, in which case a simple repower should solve it."
msgstr "Motor 1이 연결되지 않았거나 통신하지 않는 상태입니다. 갑자기 발생했다면 전원을 다시 켜는 것만으로 해결될 수 있습니다."

msgid "**Power cycle**: Unplug and replug the power cable"
msgstr "**Power cycle**: 전원 cable을 분리 후 재연결합니다."

msgid "If that doesn't work, **inspect motor cables** for loose connections"
msgstr "해결되지 않으면 **motor cable**이 느슨한지 확인합니다."

msgid "**Check** the cable connecting to the specific missing motor"
msgstr "누락된 motor의 cable을 **확인**합니다."

msgid "The motor chain is daisy-chained—a loose connection can affect motors downstream"
msgstr "Motor는 daisy chain으로 연결되어 한 곳의 느슨한 연결이 뒤쪽 motor에도 영향을 줄 수 있습니다."

msgid "Motor Connection Error"
msgstr "Motor 연결 오류"

msgid "If you see this error:"
msgstr "다음 오류가 보이면:"

msgid "This indicates communication failure with a specific motor."
msgstr "특정 motor와 통신에 실패한 상태입니다."

msgid "**Check power**: Ensure the 12V power supply is connected and LED is on"
msgstr "**전원 확인**: Follower의 12V 전원이 연결되고 LED가 켜졌는지 확인합니다."

msgid "**Check USB**: Verify the USB cable is securely connected at both ends"
msgstr "**USB 확인**: Cable 양쪽이 단단히 연결되었는지 확인합니다."

msgid "**Restart motors**: Power cycle the robot (disconnect and reconnect power)"
msgstr "**Motor 재시작**: 전원을 분리했다가 다시 연결합니다."

msgid "**Check motor ID**: The motor with the specified ID may have a loose connection"
msgstr "**Motor ID 확인**: 해당 ID motor의 연결이 느슨할 수 있습니다."

msgid "Calibration Fails"
msgstr "Calibration 실패"

msgid "**Ensure** the robot port matches the robot.id of the real robot"
msgstr "Robot port가 실제 robot의 robot.id와 대응하는지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Ensure** robot is in exact calibration pose"
msgstr "정확한 calibration pose인지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Check** that motors can move freely"
msgstr "Motor가 자유롭게 움직이는지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Verify** no joint is at a limit"
msgstr "초기 pose에서 joint가 limit에 있지 않은지 **확인**합니다."

msgid ""
"**True end stops only** — During the range sweep, move each joint **except wrist roll** to its "
"mechanical end stop, not a cable or obstacle. LeRobot sets the wrist-roll range automatically. A "
"cable pinched between links (or the robot hitting a cable) creates a false min/max and wrong "
"calibration. Check cable routing so the arm can reach its real limits."
msgstr ""
"**실제 End Stop까지 이동** — Range sweep에서는 **wrist roll을 제외한** 각 joint를 cable이나 장애물이 아닌 mechanical end"
" stop까지 움직입니다. Wrist-roll range는 LeRobot이 자동 지정합니다. Link 사이에 끼인 cable이나 cable과의 충돌은 잘못된 min/max를 "
"만들 수 있으므로 실제 limit까지 도달하도록 배선을 확인하세요."

msgid "SO-101 arm segment showing cable routing near a joint"
msgstr "Joint 근처 cable 배선을 보여주는 SO-101 arm 부분입니다."

msgid "**Re-run** calibration from step 1"
msgstr "1단계부터 calibration을 **다시 실행**합니다."

msgid "Camera Issues"
msgstr "Camera 문제"

msgid "Dark or No Image"
msgstr "Image가 어둡거나 없음"

msgid "If the camera feed is very dark or black:"
msgstr "Camera feed가 매우 어둡거나 검다면:"

msgid ""
"**Check the lens cap** — Ensure the lens cap is removed from the camera. This is a common cause "
"of dark or missing feed."
msgstr "**Lens cap 확인** — Cap을 제거했는지 확인하세요. 어둡거나 없는 feed의 흔한 원인입니다."

msgid "**Verify** the camera is powered and connected"
msgstr "Camera 전원과 연결을 **확인**합니다."

msgid ""
"Inside the `so101-workshop` container, **run** `lerobot-find-cameras opencv` to confirm the "
"camera is detected"
msgstr "`so101-workshop`에서 `lerobot-find-cameras opencv`를 **실행**해 인식을 확인합니다."

msgid "Camera Index Changed"
msgstr "Camera Index 변경"

msgid "Camera indices may change any time cameras are unplugged or replugged into your computer."
msgstr "Camera를 분리하거나 다시 연결하면 index가 바뀔 수 있습니다."

msgid ""
"Inside the `so101-workshop` container, **run** `lerobot-find-cameras opencv` to discover current "
"indices"
msgstr "`so101-workshop`에서 `lerobot-find-cameras opencv`로 현재 index를 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Update** your configuration with the new indices"
msgstr "새 index로 configuration을 **갱신**합니다."

msgid "**Verify** by checking the captured test images"
msgstr "Capture test image로 **검증**합니다."

msgid "Blurry or Out-of-Focus Image"
msgstr "Image가 흐리거나 Focus가 맞지 않음"

msgid "If the camera feed is blurry or the policy has trouble with fine visual detail:"
msgstr "Feed가 흐리거나 policy가 세부 시각 정보를 처리하기 어려워하면:"

msgid "**Check focus** — Ensure the camera lens is in focus."
msgstr "**Focus 확인** — Camera lens의 초점을 맞춥니다."

msgid "**Clean** the lens if it is smudged or dusty"
msgstr "얼룩이나 먼지가 있으면 lens를 **닦습니다**."

msgid "**Verify** the camera is fixed in place and not vibrating"
msgstr "Camera가 고정되어 진동하지 않는지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "Wrong Camera Feed"
msgstr "잘못된 Camera Feed"

msgid "If the policy receives incorrect visual input:"
msgstr "Policy가 잘못된 시각 입력을 받으면:"

msgid "**Check** camera assignments match expectations"
msgstr "Camera 할당이 예상과 같은지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Verify** the wrist camera and external camera are correctly identified"
msgstr "Wrist와 external camera가 올바르게 구분되었는지 **확인**합니다."

msgid "**Re-run** `lerobot-find-cameras opencv` to confirm indices"
msgstr "`lerobot-find-cameras opencv`를 **다시 실행**해 index를 확인합니다."

msgid "Policy Deployment Issues"
msgstr "Policy 배포 문제"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "CUDA Out of Memory"
msgstr "CUDA Out of Memory"

msgid ""
"The most likely cause during workshop evaluation is an extra policy server still running and "
"holding GPU memory. Stop the current evaluation with **Ctrl+C**, then run this in the workshop "
"container to stop all matching LeRobot policy servers:"
msgstr ""
"Workshop 평가에서 가장 흔한 원인은 종료하지 않은 추가 policy server의 GPU memory 점유입니다. **Ctrl+C**로 평가를 끝내고 workshop "
"container 안에서 다음 명령으로 해당 LeRobot policy server를 모두 종료합니다."

msgid ""
"Wait for the servers to exit and check GPU memory with `nvidia-smi`. Before retrying simulation "
"evaluation, start just one server using the [startup and readiness commands](11-sim-evaluation.md"
"#run-policy-evaluation). Always [stop the server](11-sim-evaluation.md#stop-evaluation) after "
"finishing with a policy and before starting the next one."
msgstr ""
"Server 종료 후 `nvidia-smi`로 memory를 확인합니다. [시작 및 readiness 명령](11-sim-evaluation.md#run-policy-"
"evaluation)으로 server 하나만 시작하세요. Policy 평가를 마치고 다음 것을 시작하기 전에 항상 [server를 종료](11-sim-evaluation.md"
"#stop-evaluation)합니다."

msgid "Inference Is Slow"
msgstr "Inference가 느림"

msgid ""
"If real-robot inference is slow, check that you stopped the simulation policy server. It can "
"still use GPU resources. In the terminal where you started it, run:"
msgstr ""
"실제 inference가 느리면 simulation policy server를 종료했는지 확인하세요. 여전히 GPU를 사용할 수 있습니다. Server를 시작한 "
"terminal에서 실행합니다."

msgid "Or **stop all policy servers** in the container:"
msgstr "또는 container의 **모든 policy server를 종료**합니다."

msgid "If you started the server in a different terminal, stop it there instead."
msgstr "다른 terminal에서 시작한 server라면 그곳에서 종료하세요."

msgid "Compare simulated and real camera images"
msgstr "Simulation과 실제 Camera Image 비교"

msgid ""
"These two unedited 640 × 480 frames show the visual differences a policy can encounter when "
"moving from a simulated dataset to the physical workstation."
msgstr "편집하지 않은 640 × 480 frame 두 개로 simulation dataset에서 실제 workstation으로 옮길 때 policy가 겪는 시각적 차이를 보여줍니다."

msgid "View an illustrative sim/real camera comparison and its limitations"
msgstr "Sim/Real Camera 비교 예시와 한계 보기"

msgid ""
"Simulated wrist camera showing orange gripper fingers, a yellow rack, and smooth white vials on a"
" dark mat."
msgstr "Orange gripper finger, yellow rack, 어두운 mat 위의 매끈한 white vial이 보이는 simulation wrist camera입니다."

msgid ""
"**Simulation.** First wrist-camera frame of episode 0 from [`sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923), dataset revision `a08882a61870706727c153beec6ae10ec6747146`."
msgstr ""
"**Simulation.** [`sreetz-nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923)의 episode 0 첫 wrist frame입니다. Dataset revision은 "
"`a08882a61870706727c153beec6ae10ec6747146`입니다."

msgid ""
"Physical wrist camera showing brighter orange gripper fingers, a partly visible yellow rack, a "
"blue-gray mat, and a textured white vial near the image edge."
msgstr ""
"더 밝은 orange gripper, 일부 yellow rack, blue-gray mat, image 가장자리의 표면 질감 있는 white vial이 보이는 실제 wrist"
" camera입니다."

msgid ""
"**Real hardware.** SO-101 wrist-camera frame captured on September 24, 2026, at 640 × 480 with "
"MJPEG capture configured at 30 FPS."
msgstr "**Real hardware.** 2026년 9월 24일, 640 × 480 및 MJPEG 30 FPS 설정으로 capture한 SO-101 wrist frame입니다."

msgid ""
"In this pair, the real image has brighter gripper and rack highlights with less visible detail. "
"The mat appears blue-gray rather than dark gray, and the real vial has surface texture and folds "
"absent from the smooth simulated vial. These differences suggest checking lighting, camera "
"exposure, color response, and object materials when investigating transfer failures."
msgstr ""
"실제 image는 gripper와 rack highlight가 밝아 세부가 덜 보입니다. Mat는 dark gray보다 blue-gray에 가깝고, 실제 vial에는 "
"simulation의 매끈한 vial과 달리 질감과 주름이 있습니다. Transfer 실패를 조사할 때 lighting, exposure, color response, "
"material을 확인할 이유가 됩니다."

msgid ""
"The arm pose, gripper opening, and vial layout differ between these frames. This is an "
"illustrative perception-gap comparison, **not a camera calibration test**. It does not establish "
"a field-of-view error, a sensor dynamic-range measurement, or the cause of a policy failure."
msgstr ""
"두 frame의 arm pose, gripper opening, vial 배치는 다릅니다. Perception gap을 보여주는 예시이며 **camera calibration"
" 시험이 아닙니다**. FoV 오류, sensor dynamic range, policy 실패 원인을 입증하지 않습니다."

msgid ""
"For a controlled comparison, reproduce the physical arm's measured joint pose in simulation, "
"match the vial and rack layout, and record the real camera's exposure and white-balance settings."
" Compare the resulting camera images before changing the simulation. Apply any camera-response "
"adjustment to the images used for both data collection and policy evaluation, then test its "
"effect on real-robot performance."
msgstr ""
"통제된 비교에는 실제로 측정한 joint pose를 simulation에 재현하고 vial/rack 배치를 맞추며 실제 exposure와 white balance를 "
"기록합니다. Simulation을 바꾸기 전에 결과 image를 비교하세요. Camera response 조정은 수집과 평가 image에 모두 적용한 뒤 실제 성능에 미치는 "
"영향을 시험합니다."

msgid "Overlay saved wrist images to inspect alignment"
msgstr "저장 Wrist Image를 겹쳐 정렬 확인"

msgid ""
"Use the [interactive perception-gap comparison in What Is Sim-to-Real?](perception-gap-"
"comparison) to overlay saved wrist images, adjust simulation opacity, or compare the views side "
"by side. The alternate image pair below provides another comparison."
msgstr ""
"[What Is Sim-to-Real?의 interactive 비교](perception-gap-comparison)로 image를 겹치고 simulation opacity를"
" 조절하거나 나란히 비교할 수 있습니다. 아래는 다른 image pair입니다."

msgid "Alternate pair: robot confirmed level"
msgstr "다른 Pair: Robot 수평 확인"

msgid "Inspect the alternate image pair and its capture conditions"
msgstr "Image Pair와 Capture 조건 보기"

msgid ""
"In this second pair, also captured on September 28, 2026, the operator confirmed that the "
"physical robot base was level and moved the rack to align it by eye. The simulation uses the "
"encoder pose captured for this comparison, the elbow asset correction, and measured lens "
"intrinsics and distortion. It retains the original authored camera mount; no candidate mount "
"offset is applied. The rack settled under physics before capture. The loose vials were still "
"moving slightly and are not alignment references."
msgstr ""
"2026년 9월 28일 capture한 두 번째 pair에서는 operator가 실제 base의 수평을 확인하고 rack을 눈으로 맞췄습니다. Simulation은 이 "
"비교에서 capture한 encoder pose, elbow asset correction, 측정 lens intrinsics와 distortion을 사용합니다. 원래 "
"camera mount를 유지하고 후보 offset은 적용하지 않았습니다. Rack은 physics로 안정된 뒤 capture했지만 loose vial은 조금씩 움직여 정렬 "
"기준으로 사용할 수 없습니다."

msgid ""
"The rack corners, hole positions, and gripper outlines align much more closely in this pair. "
"Brightness, highlights, and surface detail still differ. The real scene also contains a "
"calibration target absent from simulation. This is a qualitative alignment example: the rack "
"position was not independently measured, and both the lens parameters and scene alignment differ "
"from the first pair. It therefore does not isolate the effect of leveling the base or establish "
"that the camera mount is calibrated."
msgstr ""
"Rack corner, hole, gripper 윤곽은 훨씬 잘 맞지만 밝기, highlight, 표면 detail은 여전히 다릅니다. 실제 scene에는 "
"simulation에 없는 calibration target도 있습니다. Rack 위치를 독립적으로 측정하지 않았고 lens parameter와 scene 정렬이 첫 "
"pair와 달라 정성적 예시일 뿐입니다. Base 수평 효과만을 분리하거나 camera mount calibration을 입증하지 않습니다."

msgid "The arm reaches where there is no vial"
msgstr "Arm이 Vial 없는 곳으로 향함"

msgid ""
"When the arm reaches where there’s no vial, find the **first place the observation, prediction, "
"and motion disagree**."
msgstr "**Observation, prediction, motion이 처음 어긋나는 지점**을 찾으세요."

msgid ""
"**Replay one failed pickup.** Compare the camera image, the image actually sent to GR00T, "
"predicted actions, and executed motion. Is the vial visible in the model’s input?"
msgstr ""
"**실패한 Pickup 하나를 재검토하세요.** Camera image, 실제 GR00T 입력 image, 예측 action, 실행 motion을 비교합니다. Model "
"입력에 vial이 보이나요?"

msgid ""
"**Move only the vial in simulation.** Keep the arm and cameras fixed. Does the predicted reach "
"follow the vial?"
msgstr "**Simulation에서 Vial만 옮기세요.** Arm과 camera는 고정합니다. 예측된 reach가 vial을 따라가나요?"

msgid "Same reach despite moving the vial: investigate visual conditioning or learned position bias."
msgstr "Vial을 옮겨도 같은 reach라면 visual conditioning이나 학습된 position bias를 조사합니다."

msgid "Reach follows but consistently misses: check calibration and action conversion."
msgstr "따라가지만 일정하게 빗나가면 calibration과 action conversion을 확인합니다."

msgid ""
"**Check the action pipeline.** Verify joint order, units, normalization, and relative-action "
"decoding. Make sure relative actions aren’t converted twice."
msgstr ""
"**Action Pipeline을 확인하세요.** Joint 순서, 단위, normalization, relative-action decoding을 확인하고 상대 "
"action을 두 번 변환하지 않는지 검증합니다."

msgid ""
"**Try more frequent replanning.** Compare executing 16, 8, and 4 actions before requesting a "
"fresh prediction. Keep the model and test scenes unchanged."
msgstr "**더 자주 Replan해 보세요.** Model과 scene을 유지하고 16, 8, 4개 action 실행 후 새 prediction을 요청하는 경우를 비교합니다."

msgid ""
"**Improve data where failures occur.** Add successful demonstrations with varied vial positions, "
"starting poses, and recovery approaches. Test on layouts excluded from training."
msgstr ""
"**실패 구간의 Data를 보완하세요.** Vial 위치, 시작 pose, recovery 접근을 다양하게 한 성공 demonstration을 추가하고 학습에 없는 배치로 "
"시험합니다."

msgid ""
"**Change one factor at a time.** Repeat the same scenes and record wrong-location reaches as well"
" as successful pickups. Treat each explanation as a hypothesis until a controlled test supports "
"it."
msgstr ""
"**한 번에 한 요인만 바꾸세요.** 같은 scene을 반복하고 잘못된 위치로 향한 reach와 성공 pickup을 모두 기록합니다. 통제된 시험 전에는 각 설명을 가설로 "
"다룹니다."

msgid "Test policy inputs with fixed or “dummy” observations"
msgstr "Fixed 또는 “Dummy” Observation으로 Policy 입력 시험"

msgid ""
"Run this diagnostic offline, without sending predictions to the physical robot. A useful test "
"observation starts with a saved, valid observation: both camera images, the measured joint state,"
" and the task instruction. Retain the checkpoint’s saved preprocessing and action postprocessing "
"so feature names, image conversion, normalization, and relative-action decoding match deployment."
msgstr ""
"실제 robot에 prediction을 보내지 않고 offline으로 진단합니다. 두 camera image, 측정 joint state, task instruction이 "
"있는 유효한 저장 observation을 사용하세요. 저장 preprocessing/postprocessing을 유지해 feature 이름, image 변환, "
"normalization, relative-action decoding을 배포와 맞춥니다."

msgid "Show the offline fixed-observation diagnostic procedure"
msgstr "Offline Fixed-Observation 진단 절차 보기"

msgid ""
"Save the raw camera frames, the corresponding joint state, and the actual preprocessed input sent"
" to the model. Check camera assignments, image freshness, color order, resizing, and cropping. A "
"live viewer alone does not establish what the model received."
msgstr ""
"Raw camera frame, 대응 joint state, 실제 preprocessed model input을 저장합니다. Camera 할당, frame 최신성, color"
" 순서, resize, crop을 확인하세요. Live viewer만으로 실제 model 입력을 알 수는 없습니다."

msgid ""
"Predict from that fixed observation repeatedly, resetting any queued action chunk between trials."
" Fix the random seed or repeat enough times to measure prediction variability before comparing "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"고정 observation으로 반복 예측하되 trial 사이의 queued action chunk를 reset합니다. 비교 전에 seed를 고정하거나 충분히 반복해 "
"prediction 변동을 측정하세요."

msgid ""
"Change one input at a time. For a meaningful visual test, render the same simulated arm and "
"camera pose with the vial in two different positions. Hold the joint state and task text fixed "
"and compare the decoded action chunks."
msgstr ""
"입력 하나씩 바꿉니다. 의미 있는 시각 시험은 같은 arm/camera pose에서 vial 위치만 다른 두 scene을 렌더링하는 것입니다. Joint state와 task"
" text를 고정하고 decoded action chunk를 비교합니다."

msgid ""
"As an additional diagnostic, replace one camera image with a constant image of the same shape and"
" type. Keep the other inputs unchanged. This deliberately unrealistic “dummy” input can reveal "
"sensitivity to a camera, but a similar prediction does not by itself prove that the model ignores"
" vision: the other camera, joint state, or a learned action prior may dominate."
msgstr ""
"추가 진단으로 camera 하나를 같은 shape/type의 constant image로 바꾸고 나머지 입력은 유지합니다. 비현실적인 “dummy” 입력은 camera "
"민감도를 드러낼 수 있지만 비슷한 prediction만으로 vision을 무시한다고 단정할 수는 없습니다. 다른 camera, joint state, 학습된 action "
"prior가 지배적일 수 있습니다."

msgid ""
"Compare predictions offline first. For any simulated rollout comparison, reset both the "
"environment and the policy’s queued actions between conditions. See the [perception-gap "
"example](#so101-wrist-perception-gap) for why matching the arm pose and scene layout matters."
msgstr ""
"먼저 offline prediction을 비교합니다. Simulation rollout에서는 조건 사이 environment와 policy queued action을 모두 "
"reset하세요. Pose와 배치 일치의 중요성은 [perception-gap 예시](#so101-wrist-perception-gap)를 확인하세요."

msgid "Replay a recorded episode on the physical arm"
msgstr "실제 Arm에서 기록 Episode Replay"

msgid ""
"Recorded-action replay bypasses policy prediction. It checks whether the stored joint commands "
"produce a comparable physical trajectory; it does not test the policy’s visual reasoning or "
"closed-loop recovery."
msgstr ""
"Recorded-action replay는 policy prediction을 우회해 저장된 joint command가 유사한 실제 trajectory를 만드는지 확인합니다. "
"Policy의 visual reasoning이나 closed-loop recovery를 시험하지는 않습니다."

msgid ""
"Inspect a short episode with the dataset viewer. Confirm the robot, saved calibration, joint "
"order, units, action convention, and recording FPS. Workshop arm actions use native degrees for "
"the first five joints and a percentage for the gripper. Use the recorded absolute actions "
"directly; do not apply the policy’s relative-action decoding to them."
msgstr ""
"Dataset viewer에서 짧은 episode를 검토하고 robot, calibration, joint 순서·단위, action 규약, recording FPS를 "
"확인합니다. Workshop action은 처음 5개 joint가 native degree, gripper가 percent입니다. 기록된 absolute action을 직접 "
"사용하고 policy의 relative-action decoding을 적용하지 마세요."

msgid ""
"Compare the episode’s starting joint state with the real arm’s measured state. Prepare the "
"matching start pose with the supervised positioning procedure; replay does not provide a general "
"collision-aware move to the start. For an initial motion check, clear the workspace of loose "
"objects and remain at the stop control."
msgstr ""
"Episode 시작 joint state와 실제 측정을 비교하고 감독하에 위치를 맞춥니다. Replay가 collision-aware한 시작점 이동을 제공하지는 않습니다. 첫"
" motion 검사에서는 loose object를 치우고 정지 control 곁에 있으세요."

msgid ""
"Inside the workshop container, run the installed LeRobot replay command with your dataset and "
"calibrated follower identifiers:"
msgstr "Container에서 dataset과 calibration된 follower ID로 설치된 LeRobot replay 명령을 실행합니다."

msgid ""
"Stop with **Ctrl+C** if the trajectory deviates. Record the actual joint states and camera views "
"with a separate logging setup if quantitative comparison is needed; this replay command does not "
"itself save those comparison observations. Compare against the episode’s **observed joint "
"states**, as well as its commanded actions: commands and measured positions can differ because of"
" lag and contact."
msgstr ""
"Trajectory가 벗어나면 **Ctrl+C**로 중단하세요. 정량 비교에는 별도 logging으로 실제 joint state와 camera view를 기록해야 하며 "
"replay 명령 자체는 비교 observation을 저장하지 않습니다. 명령뿐 아니라 episode의 **observed joint states**와 비교하세요. Lag와 "
"contact 때문에 명령과 측정은 다를 수 있습니다."

msgid ""
"If the recorded commands reproduce the same motion but a policy rollout does not, investigate "
"policy inputs, prediction, or action-chunk execution. If replay diverges too, investigate "
"calibration, joint mapping, gripper mapping, actuator response, mounting, and contacts before "
"retraining."
msgstr ""
"Recorded command는 같은 motion을 재현하지만 policy rollout은 못 한다면 입력, prediction, action-chunk 실행을 조사합니다. "
"Replay도 다르면 재학습 전에 calibration, joint/gripper mapping, actuator response, mounting, contact를 "
"확인하세요."

msgid ""
"A simulation episode also depends on the asset geometry and joint offsets used when it was "
"collected. Matching numeric joint values alone cannot establish a matching physical pose. For a "
"stationary camera comparison, read the real arm’s encoders and reproduce that pose in simulation "
"without moving the real arm."
msgstr ""
"Simulation episode도 수집 당시 asset geometry와 joint offset에 의존합니다. 숫자상 joint value가 같다고 실제 pose까지 같다고"
" 볼 수 없습니다. 정적인 camera 비교에서는 실제 arm을 움직이지 않고 encoder를 읽어 simulation에 pose를 재현하세요."

msgid "\"It worked once but not consistently\""
msgstr "한 번은 되었지만 일관되지 않음"

msgid "**Likely cause:** Distribution shift"
msgstr "**가능한 원인:** Distribution shift"

msgid "Check if initial conditions vary between trials"
msgstr "Trial 사이 초기 조건이 달라지는지 확인"

msgid "Ensure cameras are stable and haven't shifted"
msgstr "Camera가 안정적으로 고정되고 위치가 바뀌지 않았는지 확인"

msgid "\"Grasp is always off by the same amount\""
msgstr "Grasp가 항상 같은 양만큼 빗나감"

msgid "**Likely cause:** Calibration or camera positioning"
msgstr "**가능한 원인:** Calibration 또는 camera 위치"

msgid "Re-run robot calibration"
msgstr "Robot calibration 재실행"

msgid "Check camera positioning"
msgstr "Camera 위치 확인"

msgid "Verify workspace setup matches training"
msgstr "Workspace가 학습 조건과 맞는지 확인"

msgid "Simulation and Display Issues"
msgstr "Simulation과 Display 문제"

msgid "No Simulated Camera Images"
msgstr "Simulation Camera Image가 없음"

msgid ""
"Use explicit `--cameras all presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer`. `--cameras none` intentionally "
"disables images. The first ovrtx launch can take a few minutes to warm up caches."
msgstr ""
"`--cameras all presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer`를 명시하세요. `--cameras none`은 의도적으로 image를 끕니다. ovrtx 첫"
" 실행은 cache 준비에 몇 분이 걸릴 수 있습니다."

msgid "Browser Is Blank or Controls Do Not Work"
msgstr "Browser가 비거나 Control이 동작하지 않음"

msgid ""
"Use `--browser-display` and open `http://localhost:8090` on the host. Focus the browser for "
"keyboard controls. In recording mode, **Space** starts/saves, **C** discards, and **R** "
"discards/resets. Use only one browser tab connected to the viewer at a time."
msgstr ""
"`--browser-display`로 실행하고 host에서 `http://localhost:8090`을 엽니다. Keyboard control을 위해 browser에 "
"focus를 두세요. Recording mode의 **Space**는 시작/저장, **C**는 폐기, **R**은 폐기/reset입니다. Viewer에는 tab 하나만 "
"연결합니다."

msgid ""
"Use the documented host networking. Browser display uses ports 8090, 49100, and 47998. Stop other"
" display sessions using those ports. `--browser-display` and `--rerun` are mutually exclusive; "
"Rerun/headless modes have no recording keyboard controls."
msgstr ""
"문서의 host networking을 사용하세요. Display port는 8090, 49100, 47998이며 같은 port의 다른 session을 종료합니다. "
"`--browser-display`와 `--rerun`은 함께 사용할 수 없고 Rerun/headless에는 recording keyboard control이 없습니다."

msgid "Policy Server or Checkpoint Errors"
msgstr "Policy Server 또는 Checkpoint 오류"

msgid ""
"Follow the background-server startup and readiness check in [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md"
"#run-policy-evaluation) using the same container terminal. The sim client uses `--server_address "
"localhost:8080`."
msgstr ""
"같은 container terminal에서 [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md#run-policy-evaluation)의 background "
"server 시작과 readiness 검사를 따릅니다. Client는 `--server_address localhost:8080`을 사용합니다."

msgid ""
"If readiness times out or evaluation cannot connect, run `tail -n 40 outputs/policy-server.log`. "
"Resolve the reported error before retrying; do not launch duplicate servers on the same port. "
"After evaluation, use the documented [server cleanup](11-sim-evaluation.md#stop-evaluation)."
msgstr ""
"Timeout이나 연결 실패 시 `tail -n 40 outputs/policy-server.log`를 확인하고 오류를 해결한 뒤 재시도하세요. 같은 port에 중복 "
"server를 띄우지 마세요. 평가 후 [server cleanup](11-sim-evaluation.md#stop-evaluation)을 수행합니다."

msgid ""
"Verify that `MODEL_ID` identifies a LeRobot GR00T 1.7 policy with saved configuration and "
"processors, and that the server can access its local path or Hub repository. A rename map handles"
" feature names only. See [Checkpoint Compatibility](datasets-and-models.md#checkpoint-"
"compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"`MODEL_ID`가 configuration과 processor를 포함한 LeRobot GR00T 1.7 policy인지, server가 해당 local 경로나 Hub "
"repo에 접근 가능한지 확인합니다. Rename map은 feature 이름만 처리합니다. [Checkpoint Compatibility](datasets-and-"
"models.md#checkpoint-compatibility)를 참고하세요."

msgid "Dataset and Recording Issues"
msgstr "Dataset과 Recording 문제"

msgid "Automated Collection Has Not Exported a Dataset"
msgstr "자동 수집 Dataset이 아직 Export되지 않음"

msgid ""
"`vials_state_machine --record` stages successful episodes and assembles the LeRobot dataset after"
" reaching `--num_episodes`. This is a successful-episode target, not an attempt count. Watch the "
"terminal's collection count and wait for final export before running `lerobot-dataset-viz` or "
"uploading. An early interruption can leave staged episodes without a completed dataset."
msgstr ""
"`vials_state_machine --record`는 성공 episode를 임시 저장하고 `--num_episodes`에 도달하면 LeRobot dataset을 "
"조립합니다. 목표는 시도 횟수가 아닌 성공 episode 수입니다. Terminal 수집 수를 보고 최종 export를 기다린 뒤 `lerobot-dataset-viz`나 "
"upload를 실행하세요. 조기 중단 시 완성되지 않은 임시 episode만 남을 수 있습니다."

msgid ""
"Use both cameras with `--cameras all presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer` and provide `--repo_id` and "
"`--task_name`. See [Automated Data Collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-"
"data-collection)."
msgstr ""
"`--cameras all presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer`로 두 camera를 켜고 `--repo_id`, `--task_name`을 지정합니다. "
"[Automated Data Collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-collection)을 "
"확인하세요."

msgid "Training Cannot Find a Locally Recorded Dataset"
msgstr "Local Recording Dataset을 학습에서 찾지 못함"

msgid ""
"The lesson's `lerobot-train` command selects a dataset by its Hub ID. Inspect and upload "
"`./datasets/<repo_id>` to the same dataset repository before training. In a new shell, set "
"`HF_USER`, `DATASET_NAME`, and the derived training variables again; ordinary `export` "
"assignments do not carry across shells."
msgstr ""
"실습의 `lerobot-train`은 Hub ID로 dataset을 선택합니다. 학습 전에 `./datasets/<repo_id>`를 검토하고 같은 dataset repo에 "
"upload하세요. 새 shell에서는 `HF_USER`, `DATASET_NAME`, 파생 training variable을 다시 설정해야 합니다. 일반 `export`는 "
"shell 간 유지되지 않습니다."

msgid "Dataset Already Exists"
msgstr "Dataset이 이미 존재함"

msgid ""
"Simulation recording derives its path as `datasets/<repo_id>`. Add `--resume` to append to that "
"dataset, or use a different `--repo_id` for a new collection. Real recording uses "
"`--dataset.repo_id` and `--dataset.root`. Inspect and preserve existing episodes before changing "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"Simulation recording 경로는 `datasets/<repo_id>`입니다. `--resume`으로 추가하거나 다른 `--repo_id`로 새 수집을 시작하세요."
" 실제 recording은 `--dataset.repo_id`, `--dataset.root`를 사용합니다. 경로 변경 전에 기존 episode를 확인하고 보존합니다."

msgid "Dataset Missing Images or Final Episodes"
msgstr "Dataset의 Image 또는 마지막 Episode가 없음"

msgid ""
"Record with both cameras and renderer presets. Wait for the saving indicator to clear and the "
"terminal to confirm each episode is saved. Let **Ctrl+C** shutdown finish before stopping the "
"container."
msgstr ""
"두 camera와 renderer preset으로 기록합니다. Saving 표시가 사라지고 terminal에 각 episode 저장 완료가 나올 때까지 기다리세요. "
"Container 종료 전에 **Ctrl+C** shutdown을 끝까지 기다립니다."

msgid ""
"Use `lerobot-dataset-viz` with the matching repo ID and `--root ./datasets/<repo_id>` to inspect "
"saved data."
msgstr "같은 repo ID와 `--root ./datasets/<repo_id>`로 `lerobot-dataset-viz`를 실행해 저장 data를 확인합니다."

msgid "Getting Help"
msgstr "도움받기"

msgid "If you're stuck:"
msgstr "문제가 계속되면:"

msgid "**Check this guide** for your specific error message"
msgstr "**이 안내에서** 해당 error message를 찾아보세요."

msgid "**Power cycle** the robot (fixes many transient issues)"
msgstr "**Power cycle**로 일시적인 문제를 해결해 보세요."

msgid "**Re-run camera detection** if visual behavior is unexpected"
msgstr "시각 입력이 이상하면 **camera 탐지를 다시 실행**하세요."

msgid "**Re-run** the diagnostic steps above if the issue persists"
msgstr "문제가 남으면 위 **진단 절차를 반복**하세요."

